{"message":"Your Green Rewards Card has been permanently closed successfully. You’ll receive a confirmation email and final statement within several business days.

You have 45 days from the closure request to redeem the card’s 2,150 unredeemed rewards; after that, they’ll be forfeited. If an annual fee posted within the last 37 days, a full refund may apply.

I have not closed your other cards. Let me know which card you’d like to close next."}
